Step 7: Test application inside Docker
First build the application:
mvn clean package


Build Docker image:
docker build -t user-registration .


Run the container:
docker run -d -p 8080:8080 --name registration-app user-registration


Check running container:
docker ps


Test the API:
curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/users/register \
-H "Content-Type: application/json" \
-d '{"name":"Vaishnavi","email":"vaishnavi@gmail.com","password":"12345"}'


Output:
Registration Successful!


Result: Successfully developed and executed automated test cases for the Spring Boot User Registration application using JUnit and MockMvc and deployed the application using Docker.
